  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/09/IMG_0460.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(19 fotos) El Mercado Municipal de Onda ha retomado este mi&eacute;rcoles la actividad Cocina en directo. Ha sido el turno de Vicent Llopis Peris, cocinero de Cervecer&iacute;a Ca Panera, quien ha elaborado all&iacute; mismo su tartar de at&uacute;n rojo con brotes tiernos de verduras. Las personas que se han acercado lo han podido probar tambi&eacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0446.jpg\" alt=\"img_0446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0448.jpg\" alt=\"img_0448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0449.jpg\" alt=\"img_0449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0450.jpg\" alt=\"img_0450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0452.jpg\" alt=\"img_0452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0454.jpg\" alt=\"img_0454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0456.jpg\" alt=\"img_0456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinamercatcerveseriacapanera/img_0458.jpg\" alt=\"img_0458\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuina